# Cape Fresh Protein – Website

High-converting landing page for your fresh fish & chicken delivery business serving Table View, Parklands, Blouberg, Melkbosstrand, Milnerton, Durbanville, Bellville, Brackenfell and surrounding northern Cape Town suburbs.

## Files
- `index.html` – Main page
- `styles.css` – All styling (mobile-first)
- `script.js` – Mobile menu + smooth scroll

## Before you go live

1. **Replace the WhatsApp number**  
   Search for `27XXXXXXXXX` in `index.html` and replace with your real number (country code 27 + number without leading 0).  
   Example: `27821234567`

2. **Update prices**  
   Edit the product prices and notes in the “Today’s Fresh Selection” section to match your actual current pricing.

3. **Optional branding**  
   - Change the business name “Cape Fresh Protein” if you prefer something else.  
   - Add real product photos later by replacing the coloured placeholder blocks.

4. **Hosting (low budget options)**  
   - Netlify Drop (drag & drop the folder) – free  
   - GitHub Pages  
   - Your own domain + any cheap SA hosting  
   - Even a simple shared hosting account works (just upload the three files)

5. **Domain tip**  
   Something short and local works well, e.g. `capefresh.co.za`, `tableviewfish.co.za`, `northernfresh.co.za`, etc.

## Marketing strengths built into the site
- Clear local targeting (lists every suburb you mentioned)
- Strong “fresh + cold chain + hyper-local” message
- WhatsApp as primary CTA (highest conversion channel in SA for this type of business)
- Trust signals and simple 4-step process
- Mobile-first design
- Payment methods mentioned (PayFast / Instant EFT)

## Next improvements you can add later
- Real product photos
- Google Reviews or customer testimonials
- Simple order form that emails/WhatsApps you
- Weekly “catch of the week” update
- Facebook Pixel / Google Analytics

Once the WhatsApp number is updated, the site is ready to share and start taking orders.
